WordHunterWoW_QuestEN[82500] = { title = "Worldsoul: The Rookery", description = "The stormrooks these earthen tend are wonders to behold! Such magnificent plumage, such fierce personalities!\n\nIt must be an honor to care for such creatures. But I hear there's some trouble at the Stormrider rookery and headquarters, the Stormperch. I haven't heard many details, but I'm certain our earthen allies would appreciate any assistance we can give. \n\nLook into it, {name}.", objectives = "Complete the Rookery dungeon on Heroic difficulty or higher.The stormrooks these earthen tend are wonders to behold! Such magnificent plumage, such fierce personalities!\n\nIt must be an honor to care for such creatures. But I hear there's some trouble at the Stormrider rookery and headquarters, the Stormperch. I haven't heard many details, but I'm certain our earthen allies would appreciate any assistance we can give. \n\nLook into it, <name>.You will learn:" }
